Set in a future in which the Earth's elite leave the polluted planet to settle in a space colony on Kepler-209, it is about a
team from Kepler who return to Earth several generations later to test whether it is suitable for human habitation.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
The film had its worldwide premiere at the 71st
Berlin International Film Festival.

14
